n I first read it  even sitting here reading and again I  kind of forgot about some of this stuff  and I still think it's pretty cool  just to see where George's mind was at  when he first had a taste of how he was  going to do this story I think it's very  interesting I think it's genius that he  was able to map out most of the story  before he even finished one novel that's  pretty damn cool when it just shows you  how brilliant he is so let me know guys  thanks for watching thanks for listening  I will see you guys next time bye

